然还没完全长大，但是你仍能看到他修长四肢上正在成形的肌肉，末端连着带爪的手指和脚趾。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b94c2ed95e152ce53d11a440eda8c67fc2beea89db5f0ad0c09574858198ac6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0f0e62d3b1ef3472b0ab7d9b6e41e5a815a1da73658a29fb3b8f40ccb56aca1d","logical_entry_identity":"d5f7018eea69917543fa3574e636375ceaf7b7a3f82fe66b769aef7e24d158cd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your will is a shield against assaults from crazed arcane users.\n\t\tEach time that you take damage from a spell, you punish the spellcaster with %0.2f mind damage.\n\t\tAlso, they will suffer a 35%% spell failure chance (with duration equal to the cooldown of the spell they used on you).\n\t\tNote: this talent has a cooldown.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的意志是对抗癫狂奥术使用者的盾牌。\n\t\t每当你受到法术造成的伤害，你会惩罚施法者，使其受到 %0.2f 的精神伤害。\n\t\t同时，它们在对你使用的技能进入冷却的回合中，会受到 35%% 法术失败率惩罚。\n\t\t注意：该技能有冷却时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9c8bb9fae92b0ab78ad689f41d4af6d5c6744a3c2f7b42a91c6f030145f4321","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1ef73c73f9b613adc75ca8e9b44208884db6d29a5e88482541e51da5a2cb4fde","logical_entry_identity":"ede16440f87159d365e9bfb8dedf82e266d3878c1e496925ffc37cde7de29d62","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The sandworms are gone, devoured by this shrieking, warped horror.","source_tag":"_t","target":"沙虫们已经死了，它们被这只尖啸而扭曲的恐怖所吞噬。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"df0227054cb015562456f402f84822ec8887a2c3a31e09d55927595e5a7edc08","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"24743d0796a47ba26cdfc7d56e28e4b525d01b722fe42687380cb356b2c1adb4","logical_entry_identity":"2d2bfe14dcf2f0d5f8308dfc95715bfaa98b7cfc2d6093e83cf7140706e696e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"These brilliant voratun gauntlets shine with an almost otherworldly glow. Originally used in the spellhunt, they were often used to destroy arcane artifacts, ridding the world of their influence. Pride in the fulfillment of this ancient duty practically radiates from them.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件沃瑞钽臂铠闪耀着近乎超凡脱俗的光芒。它最初在魔法狩猎中使用，常被用于摧毁奥术类装备，以消除它们对世界的影响。履行这一古老职责的自豪，几乎从这件臂铠上散发出来。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a6f984a607a3546dffda78dc9c5e643289faa3fe78435cd375223e781b6cf4c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3dda9c8b583b08192c796e442291d07273e697d0afc6bcb7deb533cf89c0e9a4","logical_entry_identity":"99824e4f0aba8126d59f875a143241c4ed81d7c9d36be6de173556554e3adf69","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hit your target with your shield 3 times for %d%% damage then quickly return to a blocking position.  The bonus block will not check or trigger Block cooldown.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用盾牌拍击目标 3 次，造成 %d%% 盾牌伤害，然后迅速进入格挡状态。\n\t\t该格挡不占用盾牌的格挡技能冷却。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06fd4ac968de0a85b62e9f63cea96a0449a90baaa4d2b2e9e5b26d51cde34e26","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"59033369c72ded475f3c2ebfe5166a370dd157f1788d00f8940ac9181a77559e","logical_entry_identity":"8a61aee24279952bdb0ec54c799d2a94daf1630ebedb92c4cc0ef436d12829da","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A thought-forged warrior wielding a massive battle-axe and clad in heavy armor.  It appears ready for battle.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位手持巨型战斧、身穿重甲的精神体战士。他时刻准备着战斗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f61fe8bd45d325b9ddce6cc329ccecec5707ffe93e8e4d3518aa3d7effc34b45","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ae5e48e17e180c432cb8dce2e43878449291629d27a646c7ed6429bb1721081","logical_entry_identity":"04fa0088b107c2408bac3c8f3847a350b2f7d250730abb515900be8125de4413","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A terrifying vampiric figure of power, with flowing robes and an intense aura of fright.  His cold, sinewy flesh seems to cling to this world through greed and malice, and his eyes betray a strength of mind beyond any puny mortal.  All nearby are utterly subservient to his will, though he stands aloof from them, as if to say he needs not the pathetic meddling of minions to help him overcome his foes.  Your eyes are drawn to a dark staff in his hands which seems to suck the very life from the air around it.  It looks ancient and dangerous and terrible, and the sight of it fills you with fervent desire.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个拥有强大力量的可怕吸血鬼，他的长袍无风自动，周身环绕着恐惧光环。他冰冷而强壮的肉体似乎在向世界宣告着贪婪和怨恨，他的眼神透露着一股睥睨天下的自信。周围所有生物都完全服从于他的意志，尽管如此，他仍对他们保持超然疏离，就好像他不需要这些废物来御敌一样。你的目光被他手里的黑色法杖所吸引，这根法杖似乎在不断的吸取周围的活力。它看起来古老而可怕，看到它的瞬间，你心底的欲望被彻底点燃了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b4d80e22dfe6e22db19e1f347989d9f0e6667dd68473ffc52fe8951a2737602","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba3b3d575531fae3611c3436f2d0c83194a61c719e6943717466d70423a41167","logical_entry_identity":"e9593af124b663ac22fb72f36c24feea670d3ba36fcb01e461e41f7134c2cd1b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"mindstar","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"灵晶"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ed1b13918c21e69f5dab55ffe136df2d5e3c1c3d49bc640762ce1d9dac1d7644","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba413fbe07fade410951f38a2f337cff84b54f9ac0ee9509da4184e051ce7318","logical_entry_identity":"5952a4d7836765b06143fd2f4c9763270e6176d3531e25839fb993eb587dd455","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s(%d to psi shield)#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s(%d 灵能盾)#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"493c4e61ea9b3ede41d31037f4aa2ef016627eac2790a64a407279c332be7468","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba45075c52b09e373af591a3806baaa9b9eac19ed1976fd76ac2aa859f7e382c","logical_entry_identity":"4abedd936b4e66ab05bb050313902e0cfebcb4e97de3c3a291a8ee269b080775","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"barbed","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"倒刺"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e0f89a6d4ee4ac7074166d4aac3f28883890973e1b13234971ac75290b2750bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba48f3b37a718d0b87754d17f23c0f4d8c8a59d34f06f063d1907e084aa45ca8","logical_entry_identity":"b0d60b91c24d234f28e4637aa0375dd139c8f4af42ae3a94b4be41e65c086f4f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mustache 9","source_tag":"_t","target":"胡子9"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"677e05da0ede3a8cb5d34c20a1aa1ea5d4da0d944ef32baea1e3afdb5f273d2a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba4d2cc86ee93f20f63aed262dac6cd98ad0d0432b63b0ab7c0ae64f434bd96f","logical_entry_identity":"4a01af271218a015ab872054a749bd76fce879547305032357091a2f3dddff83","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As you pass the rift you see what seems to be the Daikara mountains, yet they are not.","source_tag":"_t","target":"当你经过裂隙时你看到了像是岱卡拉山脉的情景，尽管它们不是。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"38f05f39aea362513fe585c66152c1e74abbde9aef23f3c80173abc473576702","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba52978986ef9719d3f8b26bbb25308fdc4171261f5c73f32c7f17b8bafd2b52","logical_entry_identity":"23b8136b26501e76c7837d99473978e48750d4cba468c55d8ef2051465b24c13","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A fang from the great warg, Rungof, still covered in blood.","source_tag":"_t","target":"巨型座狼郎格夫之牙，上面仍被血痕覆盖。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e0d6043b461df03ef47604077c80cea2ae96cbe61efa3c8f2494b3b6e40b43f3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba59c2583f194439faeacaaa56f0b346c23bc4daf8e2eb3eb97b12ea6f9225f4","logical_entry_identity":"55e218cd4570cca7121708368cb7b190a9382aaa51390bbf6205dc19aad253f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Engulfs your hands (and weapons) in a sheath of lightning, dealing %d lightning damage with a chance to daze (25%%) per melee attack and increasing all lightning damage dealt by %d%%.\n\t\tEach hit will also regenerate %0.2f mana.\n\t\tThe effects will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的双手笼罩在雷电中，每次近战攻击会造成 %d 闪电伤害（25%% 几率眩晕敌人），并提高 %d%% 所有闪电系伤害。\n\t\t每次攻击同时也会回复 %0.2f 法力值。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f7225fdcd1de5a5bcc541878e6340fc64b9a64bb5d98e8ce631b9f13fa3a7796","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba5c6a9ed93325b8a0b806f0c08d91b3a0c4a8cde0f657614cab8572ccfe64d6","logical_entry_identity":"75fab43d6e08141